      children: "Yesterday was all about visiting a place away from the Hometown,No it wasn't a holiday nor we were on a Vacation but we wanted to spend some time to relax and have some fun and relieve our stress ,\nI haven't been doing much good in my academics,its not that I didn't try but things didn't worked out for me,I went into a passive state,I was about to give up,I felt like I am done may be I can't take it anymore,I spent hours working but wasn't as productive as expected, I was never so depressed as I was until yesterday but then I gave it a thought"
